  {
   "id": "yooka-replaylee-304740@major-2025-11-14",
   "gameId": "yooka-replaylee-304740",
   "displayName": "Grab Your Pagies, It's Update Time!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-11-14T08:37:44.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey, buddy-duo adventurers! We’ve rolled out a shiny new update to keep your quest for Pagies smoother than a freshly buttered Trowzer Snake. Here’s what’s new in the world of Yooka-Replaylee:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Bug Squashing (Literally!)",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We’ve sent many of those pesky bugs packing, they have a way of interfering with gameplay and are not very nice to look at.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some weird text issues. Blastooie was hogging the Pagies spotlight!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can now swim underwater without fear of being damaged for no reason (looking at you Moodymaze Marsh).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45049132/65a0bdff9bafcd080d36f28785e3313d33760fd5.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Performance Power-Ups",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "There’s a tonne of new display options, because every buddy duo deserves upscaling, especially Yooka.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’ve improved HDR compatibility across a wide range of setups; everyone is now much more refined and detailed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45049132/b70617e733468385ff7ea57e4f7a046126518862.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Quality-of-Life Improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Improved feedback for moves and actions, so you know when you’ve nailed that Sonar Shot.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "A whole host of updates sprinkled everywhere (we wanna give you guys the best experience possible).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45049132/295f0c46e69e65faef5d4cd97e8be5595d482955.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Go Bat Ship Crazy and dive back in! This update is packed with polish, charm, and a dash of sass.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you to everyone who supplied feedback, and make sure to keep sending through anything else you find, Laylee promises to read it (eventually).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
